{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_4f0dabd0df69","title":"暗影安全","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MzA3OTgxOA==&mid=2657165844&idx=1&sn=ebd5931ca01371ded68891a9bb2d0f9a&chksm=f0db2e6201360f91d556b7d4ec766709d5b187fef2a486616ce8f4ad71699c79ecc6d4b43dd9&scene=126&sessionid=1795773346#rd","description":"暗影安全团队，是国内早期研究ICS_Security的团队，发展方向以ATT@CK攻击链技术研究为主线，信奉以攻促防的实战必要性。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"暗影安全","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM6vBFKYYadX7hnicu3d8ibbYKwaqX4KNCsuKVp39uN9WZiaw%2F0","updated":"2026-11-27T03:53:01.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MzA3OTgxOA%3D%3D:2657165844:1","title":"workbuddy体验官福利，先到先得","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MzA3OTgxOA==&mid=2657165844&idx=1&sn=ebd5931ca01371ded68891a9bb2d0f9a&chksm=f0db2e6201360f91d556b7d4ec766709d5b187fef2a486616ce8f4ad71699c79ecc6d4b43dd9&scene=126&sessionid=1795773346#rd","description":"一、&nbsp;&nbsp;兑换规则\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n1、 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;同一登录账号在同一活动期内只能使用兑换码获得一次积分奖励，该活动期内不同兑换码无法叠加兑换。\n2、&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;该活动兑换码有效期截止 2026 年 12 月 31 日。\n3、 &nbsp;&nbsp;兑换码领取积分有效期为自完成兑换后 1 个月内。\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n二、&nbsp;&nbsp;兑换流程\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n方式 1、\n&nbsp;\n打开网页&nbsp;https://www.codebuddy.cn/events/redeem/\n\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n输入与 WorkBuddy&nbsp;绑定的手机号，输入动态验证码后完成登录\n\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n输入兑换码完成兑换。\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n方式&nbsp;2、\n&nbsp;\n微信内搜索“腾讯 WorkBuddy”，打开小程序\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n用与 WorkBuddy&nbsp;绑定的手机号登录后点击右下角【我的】\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n点击【兑换权益】，输入兑换码（可提前复制好兑换码在此处粘贴）&nbsp;完成兑换。\n\n&nbsp;\n私信：workbuddy兑换码，领取。","content":"<p>一、&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;兑换规则<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />1、 &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;同一登录账号在同一活动期内只能使用兑换码获得一次积分奖励，该活动期内不同兑换码无法叠加兑换。<br />2、&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;该活动兑换码有效期截止 2026 年 12 月 31 日。<br />3、 &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;兑换码领取积分有效期为自完成兑换后 1 个月内。<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />二、&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;兑换流程<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />方式 1、<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />打开网页&amp;nbsp;https://www.codebuddy.cn/events/redeem/<br /><br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />输入与 WorkBuddy&amp;nbsp;绑定的手机号，输入动态验证码后完成登录<br /><br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />输入兑换码完成兑换。<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />方式&amp;nbsp;2、<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />微信内搜索“腾讯 WorkBuddy”，打开小程序<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br /><br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />用与 WorkBuddy&amp;nbsp;绑定的手机号登录后点击右下角【我的】<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />&amp;nbsp;<br />点击【兑换权益】，输入兑换码（可提前复制好兑换码在此处粘贴）&amp;nbsp;完成兑换。<br /><br />&amp;nbsp;<br />私信：workbuddy兑换码，领取。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FPrTu58FA79arIQGU74rJvbDtBoicQlQ8r7pPsWgDe4MIV3ydBHiaXVE4qVtXRtWibz4pWK5ZNmsicRYDB4fOveIBTQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FGna7DA6WcDrM2ibBzKrKJdXDSE91SecsHQ3DxXFOaMQpqYAIK4gialScDZWQe4sLzepkh5TkdoicjEcAJvOvRicK3FTjwlNRmI1snG1KVFUU2ec%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FPrTu58FA79arIQGU74rJvbDtBoicQlQ8r7pPsWgDe4MIV3ydBHiaXVE4qVtXRtWibz4pWK5ZNmsicRYDB4fOveIBTQ%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-27T03:53:01.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MzA3OTgxOA%3D%3D:2657165749:1","title":"论项目及时缴费的重要性","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MzA3OTgxOA==&mid